 `NOT_APPLICABLE(MIGRATIONS)`, `NOT_APPLICABLE(JOBS)`, `NOT_APPLICABLE(CACHE)`, `NOT_APPLICABLE(SESSION)`: no histories, jobs, cached data or session storage.
